1587	\section{Canonical parameters of the Pauli basis test}
1588	% Paper label sec:qld-complexity kept for cross-reference fidelity (the complexity
1589	% statements of that subsection are outside the scope of this development).
1590	\label{sec:qld-complexity}
1591	
1592	We specify a canonical setting of the parameter tuple $\mathsf{qldparams}$ as a function of an integer $R$, and bound the resulting soundness function. Here $\log$ denotes the base-two logarithm, and $\ln$ denotes the natural logarithm.
